flowchart TD
    A["User clicks Deploy"] --> B["1. git clone<br/>(branch, optional token)"]
    B --> C["2. Detect project type<br/>requirements.txt / package.json"]
    C -->|unsupported| F["Failed<br/>(message shown)"]
    C --> D["3. Generate Dockerfile.deployforge"]
    D --> E["4. docker build<br/>(logs streamed to DB)"]
    E -->|build error| F
    E --> G["5. Save deployment (version, commit, image tag)"]
    G --> H["6. docker run on free port 8100+<br/>memory/CPU limits, no capabilities"]
    H --> I{"7. Health check<br/>GET /health"}
    I -->|unhealthy| J["Remove new container<br/>old version keeps running"] --> F
    I -->|healthy| K["8. Stop old container<br/>save version for rollback"]
    K --> L["9. Successful — show URL"]
